# Exo Free — findings by Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B A55B

- Source: OpenCode Zen (`exo-free`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free (Deprecated)
- **Short description:** OpenCode Zen's "stealth" free reasoning model available **October 6–9, 2026 only (3 days)**. 1M context window, multimodal (text+image), tool calls, reasoning fixed at high effort. **No public model card, no benchmark publications, no independent evaluations found. Vendor unidentified. Slot deprecated (HTTP 410 ModelDeprecated). Was default model for fresh OpenCode installs during its brief availability.**
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/exo-free`). Chat Completions API via `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`. **Now permanently deprecated — endpoint returns HTTP 410 `ModelDeprecated`.**
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-10-06; deprecated 2026-10-09; knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `exo-free` (OpenCode Zen); `opencode/exo-free` (OpenCode model picker). No public API ID on OpenRouter, Hugging Face, or other gateways.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens claimed (OpenCode Zen, AIProMoNow, pi.dev); max output 131,072 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out; image in (claimed); reasoning yes (fixed high effort); tool calls yes; JSON mode yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** **FREE** on OpenCode Zen during limited preview (rate-limited: ~20 req/min, 50/day typical); **now unavailable (HTTP 410)**. Requests during free period may be used to improve the model (AIProMoNow, horizonlux.com).
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed; proprietary (OpenCode Zen); parameter count unknown. Vendor never identified. freeaiapi.org reports **99.4% fingerprint match with Claude Opus 5.5** via lm.ikale.io (unverified informal test).

